{
  "_notes": [
    "The Simpsons Kooky Carnival V2.0 (scarn200), a SAM redemption game: coins and tickets, no",
    "players, balls or records. Upstream had no map for it.",
    "2026-11: compiled from the ROM image. Its tables are in data the boot copies to RAM, with",
    "raw-offset pointers (descriptors 0x1CF0C, display types 0x1CC00). A.1 is the nine standard IDs,",
    "A.2 IDs 13-26 as the Feature Adjustments menu shows them; IDs 10-12 are in neither menu. Award",
    "Type 0 prints VARIABLE, 1-40 'n TICKET(S) FIXED'.",
    "No game-state fields: the shared player count and credits read 0 and 0xFFFFFFFF in play, the",
    "score-rule address 0x02110A58 is a running ticket total, and no RAM byte held a per-play award.",
    "Checked on a cabinet 2026-11-13 (ALP4K): LiveUI showed Master Volume and A.1/A.2 as the NVRAM",
    "holds them; the volume buttons moved Master Volume 61 -> 63 -> 61."
  ],
